    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d798">

                <pb facs="0808" n="704" xml:id="pg704"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 812.00/6095d.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the American Ambassador.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram—Paraphrase.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1913-02-11T16:00:00-05:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">February 11, 1913—4 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>The <hi rendition="#italic">Virginia</hi>, Rear Admiral Usher’s flagship, is due
                    at Vera Cruz about February 15; the <hi rendition="#italic">Georgia</hi> is due
                    at Tampico about February 15; the <hi rendition="#italic">South Dakota</hi> is
                    due at Acapulco about February 16; the <hi rendition="#italic">Colorado</hi> is
                    due at Mazatlan about February 14. The American consuls at the respective ports
                    have been informed.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Knox</hi>.</signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
